values ('c0d1e2f3-5a6b-4c60-9d90-0e1f2a3b4c00', 'statistics-for-social-work', 'Statistics for Social Work', 'Develop statistical literacy for ethical, evidence-informed social-work practice. Students learn to describe service populations, evaluate research and programs, quantify uncertainty, select and check analyses, use statistical software reproducibly, and communicate findings without overstating what the data can support.');

